        "accountLocked": "Your account has been permanently locked due to too many failed login attempts. Please contact an administrator to unlock your account.",
        "termsTitle": "Terms of Service",
        "termsContent1Title": "1. Overview",
        "termsContent1": "This system is a street light management and control platform operated via wireless network technology. It is developed and maintained by L&E Lighting Company. By accessing or using this system, you agree to be bound by these terms.",
        "termsContent2Title": "2. User Account & Authentication",
        "termsContent2": "Access to the system requires a registered username and password. All passwords are stored using industry-standard encryption. Users are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their login credentials and must not share their account with any third party.",
        "termsContent3Title": "3. Activity Logging",
        "termsContent3": "All user activities — including login sessions, device control commands, configuration changes, and system interactions — are recorded and stored for auditing, security monitoring, and troubleshooting purposes.",
        "termsContent4Title": "4. Prohibited Activities",
        "termsContent4": "Users are strictly prohibited from: (a) selling, distributing, sublicensing, or commercially exploiting any part of this system; (b) reverse-engineering, decompiling, or modifying the source code or any system component; (c) attempting to gain unauthorized access to accounts, servers, or network infrastructure; (d) using the system for any purpose other than its intended operation.",
        "termsContent5Title": "5. Intellectual Property",
        "termsContent5": "All software, designs, interfaces, logos, and documentation associated with this system are the exclusive property of L&E Lighting Company and are protected under applicable intellectual property laws. No rights or licenses are granted except as expressly stated herein.",
        "termsContent6Title": "6. Limitation of Liability",
        "termsContent6": "L&E Lighting Company shall not be held liable for any damages arising from system downtime, data loss, communication failures, or unauthorized access, except in cases of intentional misconduct. The system is provided \"as is\" without warranty of any kind.",
        "termsContent7Title": "7. Service Modifications",
        "termsContent7": "L&E Lighting Company reserves the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of the system at any time, with or without prior notice. Updates to these terms will be posted within the system and are effective upon publication.",
        "termsContent8Title": "8. Governing Law",
        "termsContent8": "These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Kingdom of Thailand.",
        "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
        "privacyContent1Title": "1. Data We Collect",
        "privacyContent1": "We collect the following information: (a) account details such as name, username, and role; (b) login timestamps and IP addresses; (c) device control commands and configuration changes; (d) system usage activity logs.",
        "privacyContent2Title": "2. How We Use Your Data",
        "privacyContent2": "Your data is used to: (a) authenticate and authorize system access; (b) monitor and record activities for security auditing; (c) troubleshoot issues and improve system performance; (d) compliance with legal obligations.",
        "privacyContent3Title": "3. Data Storage & Security",
        "privacyContent3": "All data is stored on secure servers with encryption at rest and in transit. Passwords are hashed using industry-standard algorithms and are never stored in plain text. Access to servers is restricted to authorized personnel only.",
        "privacyContent4Title": "4. Data Sharing",
        "privacyContent4": "We do not sell, trade, or share your personal information with third parties, except: (a) when required by law or legal process; (b) to protect the rights and safety of L&E Lighting Company, its users, or the public.",
        "privacyContent5Title": "5. Data Retention",
        "privacyContent5": "Activity logs and account data are retained for the duration of the service agreement. Upon account deletion or termination of service, data may be retained for a reasonable period as required by law.",
        "privacyContent6Title": "6. Your Rights",
        "privacyContent6": "You have the right to: (a) access your personal data stored in the system; (b) request correction of inaccurate information; (c) request deletion of your account and associated data, subject to legal requirements.",
        "privacyContent7Title": "7. Contact",
        "privacyContent7": "For questions about this Privacy Policy or to exercise your data protection rights, please contact L&E Lighting Company through your system administrator.",
        "dialogClose": "Close"
    },
